<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has output"@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> <http://purl.org/linked-data/registry#statusStable> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an activity such as a project or endeavour and something that is created or produced as a result of that activity. Examples include a building created as a result of a building project, and a journal article published to describe the results of a research investigation."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isOutputOf> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-project \n        frapo:hasOutput :my-output .\n    " .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/hasOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/> .
